  "description": "Combining diacritics are blocked after non-letters: when the character before the keystroke is in the diablock set (space, digits, punctuation), the diacritic key re-emits the preceding context instead of emitting the mark (any(diablock) + key > context). Curated from SIL Cameroon QWERTY.",
